# Harness credentials. Deliberately not anchored with a leading slash: rig resolves
# --env=<file> relative to the package, so an environment file can legitimately sit in a
# subdirectory. .env.* covers the variants that option invites; .env.example stays tracked.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
